      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WITCH OF NOVA (3) jumped well and was in the mix early before fading out of it late when 5th over 485m at Horsham in Grade 5 company. Has winning claims on her best figures. SUPER MAX (1) was safely held in tougher company last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won by 3 lengths at Bendigo (24.15) beating Bronelly Timmy in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on September 9. Key runner on best form. JED'S MEMORY (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (26.40) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning five races. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. POWER AFFECT (4) is a last-start placegetter and was in front for a fair way - in the mix again.",
